{"strongs": "H2298", "word": "כ", "translit": "chad", "root": "כ", "morph": "A:A", "pos": "particle", "gloss": "like, as, about", "definition": "כ כְּ particle like, as, about (Biblical Hebrew כְּ , q. v.); — like, as Dan 2:40 תַּקִּיפָא כְּפַרְוְלָא , Dan 4:5 ; Dan 4:32 ; Dan 5:1 +; according to Dan 4:32 וּכְּ מִצְבְּיֵהּ עָכֵד and according to his will he doeth, Ezra 6:9 ; Ezra 6:18 +; about (as Biblical Hebrew 1 a: compare Zinjirli Lzb 444 [ ן ] כשלשן מלכ ), Dan 4:16 כְּשָׁעָה חֲדָה , Dan 6:1 with infinitive (Biblical Hebrew 3 b ), Dan 6:21 וּכְ מִקְרְנֵהּ לִגֻבָּא and as he drew near, etc. Cpds.: — כְּ דִי and כִּדְנָה , see דִּי and דָּאנה ; כַּחֲדָה ; together , see חַד (sub אחד ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9603')\">BDB9603</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1768')\">H1768</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H1836')\">H1836</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2298')\">H2298</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9602')\">BDB9602</entry> | BIBLICAL ARAMAIC | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9604')\">BDB9604</entry></div><p><bdbheb><big>כ</big></bdbheb></p><p> <bdbarc>כְּ</bdbarc> <b>particle</b> <highlightword>like, as, about</highlightword> (Biblical Hebrew  <bdbheb><reflink>כְּ</reflink></bdbheb>, q. v.); — <highlight>like, as</highlight> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:40\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,40)\">Dan 2:40</ref> <bdbarc>תַּקִּיפָא כְּפַרְוְלָא</bdbarc>, <ref ref=\"Dan 4:5\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,5)\">Dan 4:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 4:32\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,32)\">Dan 4:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 5:1\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,1)\">Dan 5:1</ref> +; <highlight>according to</highlight> <ref ref=\"Dan 4:32\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,32)\">Dan 4:32</ref> <bdbarc>וּכְּ מִצְבְּיֵהּ עָכֵד</bdbarc> and <highlight>according</highlight> to his will he doeth, <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:9\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,9)\">Ezra 6:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:18\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,18)\">Ezra 6:18</ref> +; <highlight>about</highlight> (as Biblical Hebrew <b>1 a:</b> compare Zinjirli <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ldzb')\">Lzb<sup>444</sup></lookup> [<bdbarc>ן</bdbarc>] <bdbarc>כשלשן מלכ</bdbarc>), <ref ref=\"Dan 4:16\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,16)\">Dan 4:16</ref> <bdbarc>כְּשָׁעָה חֲדָה</bdbarc>, <ref ref=\"Dan 6:1\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,1)\">Dan 6:1</ref> with infinitive (Biblical Hebrew <b>3 b</b>), <ref ref=\"Dan 6:21\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,21)\">Dan 6:21</ref> <bdbarc>וּכְ מִקְרְנֵהּ לִגֻבָּא</bdbarc> and <highlight>as</highlight> he drew near, etc. Cpds.: — <bdbarc>כְּ דִי</bdbarc> and <bdbarc>כִּדְנָה</bdbarc>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>דִּי</reflink></bdbheb> and <bdbarc>דָּאנה</bdbarc>; <bdbarc>כַּחֲדָה</bdbarc>; <highlight>together</highlight>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>חַד</reflink></bdbheb> (sub <bdbarc>אחד</bdbarc>). </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Dan 2:40", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 40}, {"raw": "Dan 4:5", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 4, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Dan 4:32", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 4, "verse": 32}, {"raw": "Dan 5:1", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 5, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Ezra 6:9", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 6, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezra 6:18", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 6, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Dan 4:16", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 4, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Dan 6:1", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 6, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Dan 6:21", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 6, "verse": 21}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["כ", "כְּ", "דִּי", "חַד"], "aramaic": ["כְּ", "תַּקִּיפָא כְּפַרְוְלָא", "וּ